WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.040
This election, your choice couldn't be more
important.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.580
Our candidate is in flattering lighting and
full bright color

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:11.710
Their candidate is in grainy, high-contrast
black and white, spotted through a telephoto

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:15.220
lens from behind a bush coming back from God-only-knows where.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:18.240
Our guy points at the horizon and
holds a baby.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.550
Their guy doesn't have a baby.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:21.760
Their guy has a golf club.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:25.640
The voice over for our guy is calm, measured,
bright.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.720
Their guy gets the lower register, and sometimes,

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:29.460
we

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.320
slow

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:30.960
down.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:35.380
Our guy has clean headlines and the beautiful
lens flare America needs.

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:39.080
Here's a scary graph over a photo of the other
candidate awkwardly laughing.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:39.860
Snap zoom.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:41.580
Do you want a snap zoom like that in office?

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:44.740
Here’s a photo of our guy saluting military
veterans.

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:47.000
Jump cuts. Flashes. Static. Aggressive colors.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.360
You can't trust a guy with graphics like this.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:53.079
Our guy gets stock footage of sunrises and
an American flag.

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:56.380
Their guy's flag is upside down, and on fire.

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:59.760
Intercut with overdue bills, war, and a crying
baby.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:03.160
Our guy gets doctors and astronauts and stimulus
checks.

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:08.140
Flatline. An eagle. Hurricane. The Statue of Liberty. Crime scene tape. Ronald Regan.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:08.900
Ronald Regan.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:12.800
A girl running in a wheat field…
...to escape a dangerous sexual predator.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:13.440
Welding.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:14.740
Atomic bomb.

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:17.320
This election, the choice is yours.

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:18.320
Their guy.

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:20.240
Or our guy.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:20.920
Inspiring Slogan.

